 "summary": "A single PNP silicon bipolar transistor in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package, marked 591. It is rated -60 V collector to emitter, -80 V collector to base, -1.0 A continuous and -2.0 A peak pulse collector current, and 250 mW dissipation. Gain is 100 to 300 at -1 mA and at -500 mA, at least 80 at -1.0 A and at least 15 at -2.0 A; saturation voltage is at most -0.6 V at -1 A with -100 mA base drive, and transition frequency is at least 150 MHz.",
